        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "11a23753-2648-5397-b586-f530aa16e134",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Just Before I Go, Old School, The Girl Next Door, House of Wax, 24, FM, Touched By Love, This Is Elvis, Porky's Revenge, Wild at Heart, Die Hard 2, Honeymoon in Vegas, Backbeat, Gaudi Afternoon, Machine Gun Molly, William Eggleston in the Real World, California Dreamin', Love in Space, Devil's Due, 90 Minutes in Heaven\n- People: Courteney Cox, David Flebotte, Seann William Scott, Elisha Cuthbert, Olivia Thirlby, Garret Dillahunt, Kate Walsh, Elvis Presley\n- Songs: Love Me Tender, Su Su Su Super Ki Re i\n- Roles: Kim Bauer, Darcie Goldberg, Danielle, Carly Jones\n\nFacts:\n- Just Before I Go, previously titled Hello I Must Be Going, is a 2014 black comedy-drama film.\n- Courteney Cox made her directorial debut by directing Just Before I Go.\n- David Flebotte wrote the screenplay for Just Before I Go.\n- Just Before I Go stars Seann William Scott, Elisha Cuthbert, Olivia Thirlby, Garret Dillahunt, and Kate Walsh.\n- Elisha Cuthbert became known for playing Kim Bauer in 24, Darcie Goldberg in Old School, Danielle in The Girl Next Door, and Carly Jones in the 2005 remake of House of Wax.\n- The song Love Me Tender is featured in many films, including Just Before I Go and 90 Minutes in Heaven.\n- Su Su Su Super Ki Re i includes a B-side that is a solo piano cover of Elvis Presley's song Love Me Tender called the L.A. Unplugged Mix.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "cc330eb6-abe6-58ad-81b0-617f156d249f",
        "text": "Page: Just Before I Go. Sentence: Just Before I Go, previously entitled Hello I Must Be Going, is a 2014 black comedy drama film directed by Courteney Cox, in her directorial debut, from a screenplay written by David Flebotte, starring Seann William Scott, Elisha Cuthbert, Olivia Thirlby, Garret Dillahunt, and Kate Walsh.\nPage: Elisha Cuthbert. Sentence: She became known for playing Kim Bauer in the series \"24\", Darcie Goldberg in the college comedy \"Old School\", Danielle in the teen comedy film \"The Girl Next Door\", and Carly Jones in the 2005 remake of \"House of Wax\".\nPage: Love Me Tender (song). Sentence: The song is also featured in many other films such as \"FM, Touched By Love, This is Elvis, Porky's Revenge, Wild at Heart, Die Hard 2, Honeymoon in Vegas, Backbeat, Gaudi Afternoon, Machine Gun Molly, , William Eggleston in the Real World, California Dreamin', Love in Space, Devil's Due, Just Before I Go,\" and \"90 Minutes in Heaven.\"\nPage: Su Su Su Super Ki Re i. Sentence: The B-side is a solo piano cover of the Elvis Presley song \"Love Me Tender\", dubbed the \"L.A. Unplugged Mix\".",
